### 🟦 **Azure Arc & Azure Key Vault**

- **Lifecycle Events:**
  - Secrets are fetched via the **Secrets Provider extension**, which integrates with Kubernetes pods and enforces **ephemeral access**.
  - Secrets are **not stored persistently**, requiring revalidation on pod restart.
- **Lifecycle Description:**
  - **Minted** via Azure Key Vault provisioning.
  - **Validated** through CSI driver and pod-level scoping.
  - **Burned** on pod teardown or TTL expiry.
- **Documentation:**
  - [Azure Arc Secrets Provider](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/azure-arc/kubernetes/tutorial-akv-secrets-provider)
  - [Encryption Consulting – Azure Key Vault vs AWS KMS vs GCP KMS](https://www.encryptionconsulting.com/aws-kms-vs-azure-key-vault-vs-gcp-kms/)

